# Built site, photo images and their resized cache live on the server only
# (the nightly host backup covers /var/www/website, minus cache/). A pull
# never touches these; a fresh clone builds and runs fine without them.
/public/
/cache/
/photos/*
!/photos/*.md
!/photos/_settings.json
